  "prefLabel": "Pda 603.09 Welding and Hot Work",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 603.09 Welding and Hot Work. No person shall perform welding and hot work on a state-owned commercial pier, except a person performing such work under the terms of a written contractual agreement with the authority.\n\nSource. #8321, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10441, eff 11-1-13; ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
